{"bill": "HB1007", "session_code": "20261", "version_id": 267152, "version_label": "Conference Report", "draft_date": "2026-03-13T18:35:00", "text": "<p class=textbl>JOINT CONFERENCE COMMITTEE REPORT</p> <p></p> <p class=textbl>We, the conferees, appointed by the respective bodies to consider and report upon the disagreeing vote on <strong>House Bill No. 1007</strong>, report as follows:</p> <p class=textbl>A. We recommend that the Senate Amendment in the Nature of a Substitute (26108401D) be rejected.</p> <p class=textbl>B. We recommend that the attached Amendment in the Nature of a Substitute (26109400D) be accepted to resolve the matter under disagreement.</p> <table align=center cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"> <tr> <td style=\"PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 9.35pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 9.35pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric> </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric>Respectfully submitted,</p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric> </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric></p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric>Delegate Kathy K.L. Tran (signed) </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric> </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric></p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric>Delegate Richard C. \"Rip\" Sullivan, Jr. (signed) </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric> </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric></p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric>Delegate Israel D. O''Quinn (signed) </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric><strong>Conferees on the part of the House</strong></p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric> </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric></p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric>Senator Russet Perry (signed) </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric> </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric></p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric>Senator Scott A. Surovell (signed) </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric> </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric></p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric>Senator Mark D. Obenshain (not signed) </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric><strong>Conferees on the part of the Senate</strong></p> </td> </tr> </table> ", "digest": "fabca1d386fa90b4e0fe36e1bb7f338275c01bd26d9c6baba93784a1e45c1677", "chars": 2948, "source": "lis_api", "fetched_at_utc": "2026-07-27T15:01:15Z"}